        {
          "text": "Nomba ilyo Solomoni apwile ukupepa, umulilo waponene ukufuma ku mulu, waisa oca ilambo lyakoca na malambo yonse, elyo no bucindami bwakwa Yawe bwaisula mwi Tempele lyonse.",
